      "question_text": "The polynomial $ax^3 + 5x^2 - 4x + b$, where $a$ and $b$ are constants, is denoted by $\\mathrm{p}(x)$. It is given that $(x + 2)$ is a factor of $\\mathrm{p}(x)$ and that when $\\mathrm{p}(x)$ is divided by $(x + 1)$ the remainder is 2.\n\nFind the values of $a$ and $b$.",
